.TH LICH\-SECURITY 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
lich\-security \- Run the Lich offensive security campaigns (D1\-D6) against the Unheaded service stack.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lich\-security
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the Lich offensive security campaigns (D1\-D6) against the Unheaded service stack.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-campaign \fISTRING\fR
Campaign(s) to run: d1,d2,d3,d4,d5,d6 or all (default all)
.TP
.B \-\-dashboard \fISTRING\fR
Dashboard base URL (default http://localhost:20000)
.TP
.B \-\-gateway \fISTRING\fR
Gateway base URL (default http://localhost:21000)
.TP
.B \-\-report \fISTRING\fR
Report output path (default /tmp/lich\-reports/S39\-SECURITY\-AUDIT.md)
.TP
.B \-\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
Campaign timeout (default 5m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan \fISTRING\fR
Wotan gRPC address (default localhost:18001)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
lich\-security \-\-campaign D3
lich\-security \-\-gateway http://127.0.0.1:21000 \-\-report report.json
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
